     A stencil is a drawing, and a library is a build product.

     vveelllluumm -mmkkssyymm _C_O_D_E promotes an ordinary drawing into one
     ssyymmbbooll ...  eenndd block on stdout, so a shop's own standards
     get made on the board instead of hand-cut in ssyymmeeddiitt at


